   [program = C + (A - B), res = 3, count = 90]

   resultMap = [3 = 2]


   If we number the circles as 1, 2, and 3:
   AllGood:
   [program = A - 1 + (C - B), res = 3, count = 1]

   resultMap = [3 = 1]

